{"server":"tw","storyId":"act35side_level_act35side_05_end","groupId":"act35side","stageId":"act35side_05","title":"文物也上班","storyCode":"AS-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"4d2eec14a9966141d10c76fa26e623d20a891a5ffa5eead944a70856d11acc46","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在娜仁圖亞的哄騙下，祖拜爾被賣給拉恕爾。買賣結束後，拉恕爾的寵物開口講話，原來它們的真實身分是獸主。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g1_menatmainstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在等什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"電話。對你這樣上年紀的人來說，可能是有點新奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還要在這裡等多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要懷疑，等就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下能讓我接電話嗎？之前已經有人跟我講解過用法……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，不行，你這個機械合成的嗓音一出聲，別人會當成詐騙電話的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，按照你的說法，我們兩個的合作是對歷史上偉大同盟的效仿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那請問，幫你跑腿找寶石對我有什麼好處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，我確實有所收穫。昨天半夜你嚇到我的時候，我獲得了這隻飛到臉上的金拖鞋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什麼建議嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不敢有，不敢有，我活著就是您最大的恩賜，您是薩爾貢的祖宗，帶著您尋找寶石是我該做的，您千萬別激動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，贏得豐獲集會第一名的文物好像也是這麼一隻純金鑲藍寶石的拖鞋……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，它們應該恰好成對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半夜在大街上尖叫擾民，也是一種發家手段？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……原本成對的文物，其中一件永遠沉進河底遺失，另一件自然也失去了大半價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……請允許我好奇。這個時代的夢魘……都是像你這樣行事的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你問倒我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了搶劫、倒賣和綁架，我調查過各大部族的風俗和信仰，但真沒調查過我自己的出生地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從某個清晨日出之後，我就再也沒回去過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此說來，你難道……正走在自己的天途上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天途？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的語言）天途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不不不，我一點也不想聽到這個詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不走天途，就算是我的老祖宗逼我也沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道至今沒有踐行成年的儀式？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，又不是什麼重要的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也許有一點夢魘的血統，但那幾滴血沒把我變成暴君和征服者，我也不打算讓它影響我自己的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若不走過天途，你的血要如何被你的先祖認可？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我的老祖宗們多半都失蹤在大地盡頭了，不會像你一樣突然從博物館裡坐起來罵我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說沙阿時代的人們會在成年時剃個光頭，然後塗上香膏。但又有人說，所謂的“香膏”其實很難聞……我超好奇的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，等到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……怎樣，這麼快就有寶石的消息了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寶石掮客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，女士，十分巧合，剛剛寶石交易所的監管人放出消息，他手中有一塊寶石正待交易，各方面都符合您的描述。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我要直接去見他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寶石掮客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是……即使有我從中介紹，你也很難直接和監管人談這筆交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？我聽我手下說，她們直接找前台就能賣寶石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寶石掮客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"賣倒是容易，買就不一樣了。寶石交易所並不是一般的商鋪，你需要拿出夠份量的砝碼，才能從監管人手上直接拿到東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠份量的砝碼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我有個想法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，是的，這就是我想談的生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近期正在博物館展出的古屍……沙阿時代的無名將領。"},{"type":"narration","text":"寶石交易所年輕的監管人神情複雜地看了她一眼，然後在巨大的鍍金箱子前俯下身。\n祖拜爾以雙手交疊胸前的姿態，寧靜地平躺著。\n平心而論，娜仁圖亞認為這是祖拜爾最有價值的時刻，連那駭人的黃金面具都彷彿散發出了神聖的柔光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個箱子很眼熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是從博物館原樣搬出來的棺材……的仿製品，仿製品。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……（輕輕敲打祖拜爾的身軀）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（用手電筒檢查胸腔內部）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這可不是一般的文物，你下手輕點，別這麼不專業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我聽說它已經復活了，能夠自如行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛，我們都知道人死不能復生，都是源石技藝表演而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，如果它真的會動，你不害怕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕我買下來之後它又自己逃走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，那隻黑色的動物是你的寵物？哈哈，真美啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是寶石交易所的監管人，掌握整座城市金錢流通的人，連寵物都如此與眾不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）沃奧，是他嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅探）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在棺材旁坐下）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，你看，牠聞出來了，這種死了上千年的氣味是不可能偽造的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我跟你做交易的誠意也是半點不摻假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我知道這件文物太過珍貴，就算對你來說也沒那麼容易處理——對，我是甩了個麻煩給你，所以我不指望能賺太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我保證博物館沒辦法查到我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你給出了很重的砝碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是遠沒有到我的秤無法衡量的程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想交換什麼？我聽說你是為一顆寶石來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，本來是這樣，但來的路上我有了個新想法，那顆寶石我不需要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是外來的，給我金條就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赤金結算？我去拿適合的秤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你先把貨物移進裡間，免得被其他人看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……合作愉快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g12_gemexchange"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我就喜歡這麼爽快的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一點也不喜歡睡回這個棺材的感覺。你其實沒必要讓你的手下特地把它運出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，你別說話……稍微再忍一下，我很快就回來接你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你抓緊時間，在今天之內找到你要的那顆寶石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，千萬別忘了。我還找你有事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的報價，你意下如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……♪忘不了刀刃上的月牙，少年的真心洗成黃金♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是忘不了……沒意見，完全沒意見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就離開啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（對祖拜爾眨眨眼睛）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（對娜仁圖亞眨眨眼睛）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"期待我們的下次合作！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒說還有下次。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我也沒說還有下次。至少短期內絕不會有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個老東西還想指使我幫他跑腿？抱歉，永別了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g12_gemexchange"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……她應該看懂我的暗示了吧？娜仁圖亞，如果她真的是夢魘後人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一座寶庫正等著她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g12_gemexchange"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他終於跟著我放出的消息來到了這間交易所……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米奧，沃奧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你做得好，拉恕爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常值得我們好好誇獎一番。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
